      "locked": false,
      "text": "what Ably actually runs\n\nAWS EC2 + Auto Scaling Groups\n\ncontainer set fixed per ASG\ncustom boot service reads AMI\nper-instance watchdog respawns\nor replaces on stale image\n\nno control plane",
      "fontSize": 18,
