      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The irony: the blog post explaining this design went viral on Hacker News and took Ably's\nown website down - 500 errors, July 2021. The system running real-time messaging at\nglobal scale didn't blink. The blog explaining it did.",
